frame: map group indices past the end of the TOC permutation to usize::MAX, which callers then fail
to look up, instead of indexing out of bounds (toc.rs: index out of bounds). Test:
toc_permutation_index_bounds (crates/jxl-oxide-tests/tests/toc_permutation_index_bounds.rs).

Upstream: not reported; the code is unchanged at upstream HEAD (c0cc4c7, 2026-08-15).

